### =========================================================================
### HTTP TEST COLLECTION - POLICY MANAGEMENT API (MODULE 2)
### Compatible with REST Client (VS Code), IntelliJ HTTP Client and Postman
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = 123456

### 1. Security: Access without API Key (must return 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/policies

###

### 2. Security: Access with invalid API Key (must return 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/policies
x-api-key: invalid-key

###

### 3. List all preloaded policies (must return 200 OK with array of policies)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/policies
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

###

### 4. Filter policies by Type and Status (Individual, Active)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/policies?type=INDIVIDUAL&status=VIGENTE
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

###

### 5. List risks of Policy 1 (Individual)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/policies/1/risks
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

###

### 6. List risks of Policy 2 (Collective)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/policies/2/risks
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

###

### 6B. Get Policy 4 (Collective, already renewed, 2 active risks)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/policies/4
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

###

### 6C. Get Policy 5 (Individual, 24 months, monthly rent $3,800,000)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/policies/5
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

###

### 6D. Get Policy 6 (Collective, cancelled, cancelled risks)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/policies/6
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

###

### 7. Renew Policy 1 applying IPC (+5.10%)
# - Increases monthly rent and premium
# - State transitions to RENOVADA
# - Publishes domain event to CORE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/policies/1/renew
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ipc": 5.10
}

###

### 8. Business rule: Try to renew CANCELLED Policy 3 (must return 422 Unprocessable Entity)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/policies/3/renew
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ipc": 5.10
}

###

### 9. Business rule: Try to add risk to INDIVIDUAL Policy 1 (must return 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/policies/1/risks
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyAddress": "Carrera 15 # 90-10 Apt 402",
  "city": "Bogota",
  "insuredName": "Not Allowed Tenant",
  "insuredAmount": 1500000.00
}

###

### 10. Add risk to COLLECTIVE Policy 2 (must return 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/policies/2/risks
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyAddress": "Carrera 7 # 71-21 Torre A Of 801",
  "city": "Bogota",
  "insuredName": "New Tenant Company SAS",
  "insuredAmount": 3200000.00
}

###

### 11. Cancel individual Risk (Risk ID 2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/risks/2/cancel
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

###

### 12. Business rule: Cancel Policy 2 (cancels the policy and ALL its risks in cascade)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/policies/2/cancel
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

###

### 13. Verify risks of Policy 2 are CANCELLED after cascade
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/policies/2/risks
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

###

### 14. Mock CORE: Log event into the legacy system
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/core-mock/event
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "MANUAL_UPDATE",
  "policyId": 555
}

